  "note": "Election of the Dungannon Urban District Council, 1949. East and West Wards were returned unopposed at the nominations (Belfast News-Letter, 5 May 1949, p. 3); Central Ward was polled on Wednesday 18 May 1949 (Belfast News-Letter, 19 May 1949, p. 5). C. Abernethy and Dr. Knox Henry were new members. Returned unopposed."
